      "username": "vizkid2005",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:49:41.870Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>I have been loving ERPNext and have been raving about it to my connections.</p>\n<p>The company first gives the DRAFT invoice at delivery in case there are any changes or rejected items. Once the DRAFT invoice is signed and delivery received. The invoice is submitted in ERPNext</p>\n<p>Feedback was received that - “Instead of DRAFT, you should have something along the lines of NOT FINAL INVOICE”</p>\n<p>How can we change the text DRAFT that is printed to NOT FINAL INVOICE ?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/vizkid2005/{size}/91383_2.png",
