      "id": 484217,
      "username": "black_mamba",
      "name": "Sidharth Shah",
      "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:18:12.289Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Best thing to do would be to create a new <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/print-format\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Print Format</a>. FYI there is <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/framework/user/en/translations\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Translations</a> just in case you wanted to make similar change on ERPNext. But there is a limitation in sense that it will replace “Draft” to “Not Final” across entire application.</p>",
